## Article

```catala
declaration scope A:
  input b content boolean
  output o content integer

scope A:
  assertion b
  definition o equals 0
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala DCalc -s A
let scope A (A_in: A_in): A =
  let get b : bool = A_in.b_in in
  let set o : integer = error_empty ⟨ ⟨true ⊢ ⟨0⟩⟩ | false ⊢ ∅ ⟩ in
  let assert assert__1 : unit = assert b in
  return { A o = o; }
```

```catala-test-cli
